{
  "description": "Shared cases for the action-sheet chart and the watchlist mini chart (Android SheetChart.accept / SheetChart.sparklineFor, iOS the same names in WatchSheetChart.swift). 'accept': candles as [UTC epoch day, price] (open = high = low = close = price, openTime = day × 86 400 000); convert = USDT fallback converted to the fiat quote; dailyRates = fiat per USD per UTC day; currentRate = fiat per USD now; expected = first/last close of the accepted series or null (no chart). The fallback is only used when last close × rate (rate of the last candle's day, else currentRate) is within 25 % of the pair price; no pair price or no rate at all = null. 'sparkline': USDT closes of the base asset, pair price and USD per unit of the quote; shown only within 25 % (last close vs price × quoteUsd). Numbers compared with tolerance 1e-9 (relative). 'widget': single-widget chart (Android/iOS WidgetChartGeometry.pairCandles): candles of the pair from the fallback chain (same layout as 'accept'), shown only when the last close is within 25 % of the pair price; no price = no chart (not checkable); invalid candles are dropped first, fewer than 2 = no chart. USDT → USD per candle like the portfolio value history (UsdtUsdRates.on): usdtLive = live USDT/USD (used for candles on or after 'today', UTC epoch day, default = day of the last candle), usdtDaily = USDT/USD daily close per UTC day (earlier candles); a day without a (plausible) rate counts as 1 (approximation); without usdtLive and usdtDaily everything at 1. usdtAssumed (optional) = expected note «USDT = 1 assumed» (SheetChart.usdtParityNote with SheetChart.usdtApproximate over the accepted candles: true as soon as one used day was approximated). 'sparkline' usdtUsd = live USDT/USD (optional, default 1): check is price × quoteUsd ÷ usdtUsd against the last USDT close (quoteUsd of a USDT quote already carries USDT/USD).",
